        "created_at": "2016-03-03T06:41:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Indestructible, according to the rulebook, means it can’t leave play (including to the hand). So, multiple tools is a valid state.</p>\n<p>And with Overdrive, you can get up to three of each into play. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=9\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\"></p>",
