      {
        "id": 164130,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-03T18:19:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Indestructible means that so that you don't have a bunch of ways around an effect that should be really cool.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>A bunch of ways? &nbsp;Again, the only way around it that I can think of is Into the Stratosphere, which doesn't work on indestructible cards regardless of what indestructible means. &nbsp;What other ways are there?</p>",
