        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-03T20:49:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Belle Sorciere\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Belle Sorciere:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Are the current definitions really so problematic that they need to be changed?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Need to? &nbsp;Certainly not. &nbsp;The misunderstandings that it causes aren't really detracting from anyone's enjoyment of the game. &nbsp;But it is causing misunderstandings, and I like trying to figure out how to best resolve such things in theory even of those changes are never implemented.</p>",
